  - fdsn
  - webassembly
  - typescript
abstract: >-
  Browser-native computational seismology platform integrating 8 global FDSN
  seismic networks (USGS, EMSC, GeoNet, INGV, GFZ, IPGP, GA, SSN) and Colombia's
  SGC historical catalog since 1610. Implements Gutenberg-Richter (Aki 1965 &
  Weichert 1980), Gardner-Knopoff declustering, Omori-Utsu aftershock decay,
  temporal ETAS forecasting, point-source Cornell-McGuire PSHA with Vs30 site
  amplification in dedicated Web Workers, 2D Wadati-Benioff cross-sections,
  synthetic accelerograms, and an in-browser DuckDB-WASM analytical star schema
  with Apache Parquet export.
